{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4634069","formula":"C₁₀H₁₅NO₂","hill":"C10H15NO2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":10.0,"H":15.0,"N":1.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Homoveratrylamine","ru":"3,4-диметоксифенетиламин"},"descriptions":{"en":"3,4-Dimethoxyphenethylamine (DMPEA or 3,4-DMPEA), also known as homoveratrylamine, 3-desmethoxymescaline, or O,O-dimethyldopamine, is a chemical compound of the phenethylamine family. It is an analogue of the major human neurotransmitter dopamine where the 3- and 4-position hydroxy groups have been replaced with methoxy groups. It is also closely related to mescaline (3,4,5-trimethoxyphenethylamine; 3,4,5-TMPEA) and to 3,4-dimethoxyamphetamine (3,4-DMA).","ru":"3,4-диметоксифенилэтиламин (DMPEA) — это химическое соединение из класса фенилэтиламинов. Структурно схож с нейротрансмиттером дофамином, где в мета- и пара- положении гидроксильные группы заменены на метокси-группы."},"fame":9,"pubchemCid":8421,"mass":181.23,"charge":0,"smiles":"COC1=C(C=C(C=C1)CCN)OC","inchikey":"ANOUKFYBOAKOIR-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"2-(3,4-dimethoxyphenyl)ethanamine","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"8421","atoms":28,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.798,"y":1.698,"z":-0.44,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.822,"y":-0.694,"z":0.537,"el":"O"},{"x":4.912,"y":0.36,"z":0.195,"el":"N"},{"x":2.674,"y":-0.246,"z":-0.664,"el":"C"},{"x":1.221,"y":-0.361,"z":-0.347,"el":"C"},{"x":3.5,"y":0.232,"z":0.537,"el":"C"},{"x":0.376,"y":0.732,"z":-0.542,"el":"C"},{"x":0.707,"y":-1.561,"z":0.143,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.983,"y":0.624,"z":-0.246,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.497,"y":-0.576,"z":0.245,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.652,"y":-1.669,"z":0.439,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.958,"y":2.597,"z":0.655,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.68,"y":-1.138,"z":-0.512,"el":"C"},{"x":3.051,"y":-1.216,"z":-1.015,"el":"H"},{"x":2.8